<title>GERMANY: German Aug wholesale sales fall 0.9 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>German Aug wholesale sales fall 0.9 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES	 Aug 96     Jul 96	 Aug 95</p>
<p>REAL TERMS</p>
<p> Mth-on-mth change (adj,pct)   -0.9	 +0.6	  -1.0</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change   (unadj)     -2.0	 +7.8	  +1.4</p>
<p> Index (adj, base 1991)	 101.2	102.1	  100.1</p>
<p>NOMINAL TERMS</p>
<p> Mth-on-mth change (adj,pct)   -0.9	 +0.9	  -0.6</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (unadj)	 -3.0	 +7.3	  +2.2</p>
<p> Index (adj, base 1991)	 102.1	103.0	 101.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Month-on-month and index figures are seasonally and calendar adjusted. Year-on-year is unadjusted.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
